 mm/hugetlb_vmemmap.c |   42 +++++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 mm/hugetlb_vmemmap.h |    8 +++----
 3 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

--- a/mm/hugetlb.c~hugetlb_vmemmap-use-folio-argument-for-hugetlb_vmemmap_-functions
